{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12214170","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12214170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1221417001:1":{"text":"いいですか、カールさん、これが最後の授業です。","source_cn":"卡尔，听好，这是我教给你的最后一课。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBDFBAD9E4794822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1221417002:1":{"text":"ボクが最後に教えることは……勝手に人にあだ名をつけないこと！ボクの名前はロンロンですよ！","source_cn":"最后一课就是……不要给别人乱起外号啊！我叫满满！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96F454FC7CD4DA6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221417003:1":{"text":"ご、ごめん！ハム、あいや、ロンロン先生！","source_cn":"对不起！仓、啊不！满满老师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x984EA0DD4AF5E8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221417004:1":{"text":"カールさん、これは先ほどもらったレシピの代金です。「先生」からの贈り物だと思って、受け取ってください。","source_cn":"卡尔，这是刚才卖掉配方的钱，拿着吧，就当是我作为“战斗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F62F281FE5877BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221417005:1":{"text":"だ、だめだよ！こっちが学費を払うべきなのに、逆にお金をもらうなんて……！","source_cn":"不！老师教我变强，我还没付学费，我不能收钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EC8CE819797A637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221417006:1":{"text":"ただではあげませんよ。このお金を使って、もっと強い先生に弟子入りしてください。そしてその人から、家族や友だちを守る術を学ぶのです！","source_cn":"并不是白白让你收下，你要好好利用这些钱，去拜访更强的老...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0DE7E78E21CBEEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221417007:1":{"text":"もっと自信をつけて、ロンロンのような強い、勇敢な戦士になってください。できますか？","source_cn":"你还要变得自信、坚强、勇敢，像满满我一样。怎么样，可以...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05C3D376B614DB7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221417008:1":{"text":"……も、もちろん！僕には自信があるからね！","source_cn":"……那是当然！我、我有这个信心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x389685D1EF33DA05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221417009:1":{"text":"それでよろしい！では、この辺でお別れしましょう。","source_cn":"很好，那么，我们该告别了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5414277DA973D7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221417010:0":{"text":"うう……あなたの言葉は一生忘れないよ、ハムスター先生！","source_cn":"呜呜……我会记住您的话，仓鼠老师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x956FF588E54AE5B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}